  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN278.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">iravukkuṟikkaṇ talaimakaṉ ciṟaippuṟamākat talaimakaṭkut tōḻi colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What the confidante said to HER while HE was behind the hedge during the night tryst.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN278.1">
        <l>kuṇakaṭaṉ mukanta toḷḷai vāṉam</l>
        <l>paṇaikeḻu vēntar palapaṭait tāṉait</l>
        <l>tōṉirait taṉaiya vāki <anchor n="1"/>valaṉērpu</l>
        <l>kōṉimir koṭiyiṉ vacipaṭa miṉṉi</l>
        <l>yurumura ṟatirkura ṟalaiip pāṉāṭ</l>
        <l>perumalai mīmicai muṟṟiṉa vāyiṉa</l>
        <l>vāḷilaṅ kaṭu<supplied>vī</supplied> tāay nāḷai</l>
        <l>yiruveti raṅkaḻai yōṅkiya tīṇṭi</l>
        <l><anchor n="2"/>varuvatu mātō vaṇpari yunti<anchor n="3"/></l>
        <l>naṉiperum parappi ṉammūr muṉṟuṟaip</l>
        <l>paṉiporu maḻaikkaṇ civappap paṉṉāṇ</l>
        <l>muṉipaṭa rakala muḷkuvaṅ kollō</l>
        <l>maṇimaruṇ mēṉi <anchor n="4"/>yāynalan tolaiyat</l>
        <l>taṇivarun tuyarañ ceytō</l>
        <l>ṉaṇikiḷar neṭuvarai yāṭiya nīrē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="1">The hollow clouds that drew [water] from the eastern sea,</l>
        <l corresp="3">rising clockwise, being like the hide [shields] put in rows</l>
        <l corresp="2">of the king’s army with many weapons, equipped with large drums,</l>
        <l corresp="4">flashing so as to split [the sky], like banners held erect by a staff,</l>
        <l corresp="5">showering [rain] with a shaking voice, thunder rolling, at midnight,</l>
        <l corresp="6">they have become full-grown on the height of the big mountain.</l>
        <l corresp="7">Tomorrow, spreading nearby blossoms shining with light,</l>
        <l corresp="8">gripping the pretty poles of large bamboo that have become high,</l>
        <l corresp="9">won’t it come  along the river with liberal motion,</l>
        <l corresp="10">in the huge expanse by the front ghat of our village,</l>
        <l corresp="11">– so that [our] rain eyes fighting with tears become red, many days,</l>
        <l corresp="12">so that [our] hateful affliction departs, will we enter? –</l>
        <l corresp="15">the water that played on the long mountain, decoratively shining,</l>
        <l corresp="14">of him who caused [this] misery difficult to appease,</l>
        <l corresp="13">so that the choice beauty of [our] sapphire-like bodies is lost?</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

